{"id":73246175539536,"name":"[UPD] Spider Tag!","desc":"⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻\nIn Spider Tag, you climb walls, tag people, or don't.\n\nCustomize with skins, hats, and colors.\nEarn coins, find secrets, and get on the leaderboard.\n⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻\n᚛ Devices you can play on:\n⦒ mobile phone\n⦒ tablet\n⦒ pc or laptop\n⦒ console\n⦒ virtual reality support works, but work in progress.\n⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻\nPremium users unlock a premium hat permanently.\nif you buy VIP, you support the developers, get a skin, hat, and extra private server controls for even more fun!\n⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻\nSpider Tag uses inverse kinematics for the advanced physics, and you can walk on walls, ceilings, and even below the map where there's a giant maze to explore, or check out the cave with glowing crystals!","path":"/game/73246175539536-spider-tag","slug":"73246175539536-spider-tag","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6d9f7a3956b25817c1e06b00f1a1d02c0a37290d34328560662d4c8d40eab87d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-879c862cadad8baeabce7a64aa560b3c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":75,"visitor":38330557,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-12T14:33:04.688Z","creator":{"name":"Spider tag community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"UPD-Spider-Tag!-Spider-tag-Scale-and-Width-changer-58008","_id":"68ebbc20b3814509f5cf59ac","title":"Spider tag speed/jumpPower/Scale/Width changer v2.0","game":{"_id":"68ebbc20b3814509f5cf59a7","gameId":73246175539536,"name":"[UPD] Spider Tag!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":73246175539536},"features":"This script change your speed,jumpPower,scale and width","tags":["speedertag","speeder","tag","speeder tag","robloxspeedertag"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/Xuvjk5YB\"))()","owner":{"_id":"68d950dcc0c2278b0112bdc8","user